### Explain a concept
POST {{StudyBuddy.API_HostAddress}}/api/study/explain
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userMessage": "What is dependency injection?",
  "studyMaterial": "Dependency injection is a design pattern where a class receives its dependencies from an external source rather than creating them itself. This makes code more testable and loosely coupled."
}
